  "abstract": "Remove explicit recurrence entirely (increment-only) to test necessity of recurrence. Invariances: forward U/V normalization, LN before gating. Base k=320,p=32,H=96,\u03b3_end=0.99. Loss: MAE+curvature (\u03bb=1e-4) + tiny V-ortho (\u03bb=1e-6).",
